+# Native SDK 0.9.5 Breaking Upgrade Task Contract
+
+> Date: 2026-08-23
+> Status: COMPLETE
+> Risk: high
+> Orchestration: panel, one writer plus two independent read-only reviewers
+
+## Goal
+
+Upgrade the exact official Native SDK, CLI and ScriptC toolchain from the active
+0.9.1 overlay baseline to Native SDK 0.9.5 and ScriptC 0.0.33. Rebase only the
+Volt runtime seams that remain necessary, delete absorbed or invalid patches
+from the active inventory, publish a new immutable sibling, and switch the
+stable pointer only after deterministic validation.
+
+## Frozen Scope
+
+- Pin `@native-sdk/core`, `@native-sdk/cli`, and the platform CLI to `0.9.5`.
+- Pin ScriptC and its compiler/runtime packages to `0.0.33`.
+- Rebase the Volt runtime overlay and ScriptC integer-provenance fix onto clean,
+  hash-verified 0.9.5 sources.
+- Migrate every active SDK path, resolver, generated build input, integrity
+  check, and package script from `0.9.1-patched` to `0.9.5-patched`.
+- Re-record metadata and verification evidence for the new protocol, journal,
+  automation, compiler, and build-tool identities.
+
+## Non-Goals
+
+- Do not enable SQLite, tray/accessory mode, services, credentials, or secondary
+  windows merely because 0.9.5 exposes them.
+- Do not turn the quarantined screen-capture seam into a product capability.
+- Do not change TS Core, Zig, Native runtime, or Rust agentd ownership boundaries.
+- Do not commit, push, deploy, delete historical evidence, or delete immutable
+  rollback siblings in this task.
+
+## Exact Upstream Identity
+
+| Artifact | Identity |
+|---|---|
+| Native SDK tag | `0.9.5` |
+| Native commit | `80d1c46` |
+| CLI identity | `native 0.9.5 (commit 80d1c46, automation protocol 0x51f7889bbe3305e7)` |
+| ScriptC | `0.0.33` |
+| SDK frontend TypeScript | `@typescript/old` = `typescript@6.0.3` (CLI nested dependency) |
+| CLI package.json SHA-256 | `bd20de53865a2b3e5de010b64b9695d4f050ae6527c4b0e356ff6939fc19651e` |
+| AppKit source SHA-256 | `bfa5b2c21092d102981a51080b47f617c1f57a8e2cf082fcef961158c5ba4487` |
+| source tree SHA-256 | `c9f4e6d93e782c3d5bc6133c78ffe24c95de1bf9a23b40e2f6ff2ba68a7de73d` |
+| Darwin package SHA-256 | `19d46a648c89e37e69239e870190ad606632151ccc62993462be9c9ad3244576` |
+| Darwin binary SHA-256 | `3a7e6849a9938a76d3a86cc9d9dc19be8b69299280c794a17828df02bca38155` |
+
+## Release-Note Migration Matrix
+
+| Version | Breaking or migration-sensitive area | Volt action |
+|---|---|---|
+| 0.9.2 | accessory apps and window content-frame/geometry fixes | keep current dock/tray behavior; remove the absorbed content-frame overlay from active inventory |
+| 0.9.3 | large Msg unions, manifest menu, file drop, platform/runtime expansion | remove the absorbed large-union quota overlay; revalidate external-core and platform-feature generation |
+| 0.9.4 | window restore policy and ScriptC 0.0.33 | keep official restore defaults; regenerate compiler provenance and window lifecycle evidence |
+| 0.9.5 | JSON manifest preference, registered-image crop, installed toolchain resolver, complete SQLite SDK siblings | retain `app.zon` fallback, prevent dual-manifest drift, use the published ScriptC entrypoint, keep SQLite disabled until separately contracted |
+
+## Overlay Classification
+
+The active 0.9.5 inventory contains two version-specific patches. Historical
+patch files stay in the repository for audit but are not applied.
+
+| Classification | Patch or behavior | Decision |
+|---|---|---|
+| absorbed | `native-sdk-0.6.0-macos-content-frame.patch` | delete from active inventory |
+| absorbed | `native-sdk-0.6.0-ts-env-validation-quota.patch` | delete from active inventory |
+| absorbed | `native-sdk-0.8.3-corewire-large-message-union.patch` | delete from active inventory |
+| rebased | secure input, surface text edit, input group, automation pacing | merge into `native-sdk-0.9.5-volt-runtime.patch` |
+| rebased | external TS host, shortcut capture lifecycle, platform feature | merge into `native-sdk-0.9.5-volt-runtime.patch` |
+| rebased | window-chrome journal/replay | merge into `native-sdk-0.9.5-volt-runtime.patch` and require fingerprint/replay regressions |
+| quarantined | screen capture | keep fail-closed compile surface only; no advertised capability or success state |
+| rebased | ScriptC integer provenance | `native-sdk-0.9.5-scriptc-integer-provenance.patch` against exact compiler 0.0.33 |
+
+## Acceptance Gates
+
+1. Both patches pass strict `git apply --check` and `git apply` on a clean,
+   fixed-hash 0.9.5 staging tree.
+2. Candidate metadata records exact package, source tree, binary, toolchain,
+   patch and payload hashes; active inventory length is exactly two.
+3. ScriptC provenance, external-core roundtrip, secure-input/journal/replay,
+   screen-capture quarantine, and macOS host compile regressions pass.
+4. `bun run typecheck` and `bun run test:core` pass against `0.9.5-patched`.
+5. Native `test`, strict `check`, and ReleaseFast `build` pass against the exact
+   0.9.5 CLI and candidate overlay.
+6. Overlay integrity proves immutable sibling publication, drift rejection,
+   payload freshness, and continuous stable-link readability.
+7. Two independent read-only reviewers report no unresolved P0/P1 finding.
+
+## Rollback
+
+- Preserve `.artifacts/native-sdk/0.9.1-patched` and its immutable sibling
+  `.native-sdk-published.0.9.1-patched.bMxpAB`.
+- Pre-upgrade repository snapshot is commit `8cd27813614e4c5a194fb553c763afd9f32386ff`;
+  its prepare script SHA-256 is
+  `41d434afd82ddaf7d1cf3f28b14c44da16f84b3baf3ac6bfb0722a0f8b73705e`.
+- Rollback restores package/lock/scripts/patch/path files from that snapshot and
+  repoints the stable SDK path to the preserved 0.9.1 sibling. It does not
+  delete user data, generated evidence, or any immutable SDK sibling.
+
+## Current Evidence
+
+- Official latest release and package identities: PASS.
+- Runtime patch strict apply on vanilla 0.9.5: PASS.
+- ScriptC 0.0.33 provenance patch strict apply and focused regression: PASS.
+- Immutable 0.9.5 publication: PASS at
+  `.artifacts/native-sdk/0.9.5-patched` ->
+  `.native-sdk-published.0.9.5-patched-candidate-v13.svu3zt`, with published
+  payload SHA-256
+  `eb3a99cffd651c328aef6b8d10d57e3dc7c34529870d3278dc6eee2470a8cbd2`.
+- Overlay integrity: PASS, including immutable reuse, tamper detection, drift
+  rebuild, and preservation of the previous sibling.
+- Project TypeScript typecheck: PASS; TS Core behavior tests: PASS (114 suites).
+- Official Native strict checker: PASS (18 Markup files).
+- Official Native test: PASS (21/21 build steps), followed by app-local Native
+  extension tests: PASS.
+- ReleaseFast build: PASS (18/18 build steps), producing
+  `native-ui/zig-out/bin/volt-native-poc`.
+- Focused migration regressions: ScriptC integer provenance, external-core
+  unbound roundtrip, screen-capture quarantine, and macOS host compile: PASS.
+- Pre-edit panel reviews: FAIL, retained in `.mailbox/native-sdk-095-*.md` and
+  used as required migration findings rather than completion evidence.
+- Final post-edit panel review: PASS from two independent read-only reviewers;
+  no blocking findings remain.
